  "title": "Community Action - Cross Party Group",
  "purpose": "Community groups and organisations support and sustain critical social infrastructure, provide activities, opportunities and essential support for local people, and enjoy high levels of trust locally. are powered by thousands of volunteers, alongside a smaller number of paid staff, often operating at the limit of capacity. are innovating with people-centred approaches that strengthen resilience and wellbeing of individuals and communities. The Cross-Party Group on Community Action brings people together to champion stronger, fairer and more connected communities across Wales. It promotes community-led action which leads to happier, healthier and more resilient places.",
